---
source: crates/leptoskit_db_macros/src/tests.rs
expression: "report.join(\"\\n\")"
---
unknown action: a policy governs `select`, `insert`, `update`, `delete`, or `all`, optionally after `deny`: `#[db::policy(deny insert, |row, cx| …)]`
no actions: name the actions the policy governs, such as `select,`
one parameter: a policy's rule takes the row's columns and the request: `|post, cx| …`
unknown option: after the rule, a policy takes `message = "…"`
missing comma: expected `,`
